[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/Therapy room.png" fade="0.0"]
audio music "res://assets/audio/Cosy therapist office, ambient sound of the city s.mp3"
audio music "res://assets/audio/Silent clock ticking.mp3"
set {flags.met_anna} = true
[voice path="res://assets/audio/audio.wav" volume="-4.0"]
bea: Anna Volkov, 9 AM. Work stress, insomnia..
join anna (Nervousness) leftmost
audio "res://assets/audio/Door sound - Entering the room.mp3"
[voice path="res://assets/audio/audio (1).wav" volume="-10.0"]
narrator: She arrives three minutes early. You know this because she pointedly checks her watch when you open the door at the scheduled time.
[voice path="res://assets/audio/audio (2).wav" volume="0.0"]
narrator: Your desk is in a different configuration by the time you've both sat down.
audio "res://assets/audio/woman taking a sit on a leather sofa.mp3"
[voice path="res://assets/audio/audio (3).wav" volume="0.0"]
anna (Amusement): "Sorry, ... Anyway."
player: <Empty Text Event>
- Let it go.
	narrator: She seems relieved you didn't mention it. You file it away for later.
	update anna (Relief)
	do PatientManager.add_therapy("anna", 20)
- "You reorganized my desk."
	anna (Disapproval): "It was just — the pen cup was on the left. That doesn't make sense."
	player: "Does it need to make sense?"
	anna (Annoyance): "...... Anyway."
	do PatientManager.add_therapy("anna", -5)
anna (Sadness): "The sleep thing, That's the main issue. I wake up at four and just — lie there. Thinking about what I didn't finish."
player: "What kind of things?"
- Work tasks, you mean? | [if {stats.knowledge} >= 2] [else="disable"]
	anna (Anger): "Yes. Mostly." .... "Work things."
	narrator: You note the hesitation. She notes you noting it. A small negotiation passes between you.
	do PatientManager.add_bond("anna", 10)
	do GameState.add_stat_xp("knowledge", 1)
- "Is there a particular project weighing on you?"
	anna (Embarrassment): "I — yes. There are several. I keep a log."
	narrator: She produces a color-coded notebook.
	do PatientManager.add_bond("anna", 5)
- "That sounds exhausting."
	anna (Relief): "It is..."
	do PatientManager.add_therapy("anna", 3)
anna: "My boss, He gives me a lot of latitude. Which is obviously ideal."
player: "Obviously."
narrator: She doesn't look like it's ideal.
narrator: Something about the word — "obviously" — doesn't land right.
[stat_check stat="perception" result="anna_latitude_check"]
if {anna_latitude_check}:
	narrator: The jaw. A slight compression before she spoke, then the word chosen carefully. She's been managing this for a while — the freedom she isn't sure she wanted.
narrator: Something registers. What do you file away?
- "Anyway" as a hard pivot | [if {discoveries.anna_anyway_tell} != true] [else="hide" disco="anna_anyway_tell"]
- Discomfort with autonomy | [if {anna_latitude_check} and {discoveries.anna_autonomy_discomfort} != true] [else="hide" disco="anna_autonomy_discomfort"]
- Nothing stands out yet.
narrator: Before you can push further, she's already pivoting.
anna (Caring): "The desk — I could actually show you. A better layout."
player: "Please."
narrator: What follows is four minutes of silent, methodical rearrangement, conducted with the focused intensity of someone defusing a bomb she personally assembled.
[photo_opportunity id="anna_desk_demo" patient="anna" title="The Desk Demonstration" description="Anna reorganizes a stranger's workspace with surgical precision and audible satisfaction." portrait="res://assets/photos/anna/desk_demo.png"]
if {flags.last_photo_success}:
	narrator: Something in her expression as she steps back — a private, complete satisfaction — lands perfectly in the frame.
	do PatientManager.add_therapy("anna", 3)
else:
	narrator: By the time you reach for your phone, she's already looking away. The moment dissolves.
anna (Blush): "Anyway. The sleep thing."
player: "Right, The sleep thing."
narrator: Four minutes of focused rearrangement. What does it tell you?
- "Anyway" as a hard pivot | [if {discoveries.anna_anyway_tell} != true] [else="hide" disco="anna_anyway_tell"]
- The desk rearrangement | [if {discoveries.anna_desk_compulsion} != true] [else="hide" disco="anna_desk_compulsion"]
- Skip it
[add_note patient="anna" note="Presents with insomnia and work stress. Strong organizational compulsions — rearranged the office within two minutes of arrival."]
[add_note patient="anna" note="States boss gives her full autonomy. Her expression suggests this is not entirely welcome."]
leave anna
do PatientManager.mark_session_done("anna")
jump between_patients/